---
const controlItems = ["jawax_api — Phoenix REST", "Postgres", "Oban jobs"];
const mediaItems = ["jawax_ingest — RTMP", "jawax_transcode — Membrane + FFmpeg", "jawax_sfu — Go + Pion"];
---

<section class="reveal border-b border-white/10 bg-card/20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground md:text-3xl">
			Control plane and media plane, split on purpose.
		</h2>
		<p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">
			The media node keeps serving already-live streams off a local
			stream-key cache even if the control plane goes down for a moment.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-stretch gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-center">
			<div class="rounded-md border border-[color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-plane-control)_55%,transparent)] bg-[color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-plane-control)_8%,transparent)] p-6 lg:w-72">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase" style="color: var(--color-plane-control)">
					Control plane
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-foreground">
					{controlItems.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3 self-center lg:flex-col">
				<span class="h-px w-8 bg-white/15 lg:h-8 lg:w-px"></span>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
					<span class="heartbeat-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background-color: var(--color-plane-control)"></span>
					<span class="heartbeat-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/50" style="animation-delay: 260ms"></span>
					<span class="heartbeat-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background-color: var(--color-plane-media); animation-delay: 520ms"></span>
				</div>
				<span class="font-mono text-xs whitespace-nowrap text-muted-foreground">Postgres · license heartbeat</span>
				<span class="h-px w-8 bg-white/15 lg:h-8 lg:w-px"></span>
			</div>

			<div class="rounded-md border border-[color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-plane-media)_55%,transparent)] bg-[color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-plane-media)_8%,transparent)] p-6 lg:w-72">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.15em] uppercase" style="color: var(--color-plane-media)">
					Media plane
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-foreground">
					{mediaItems.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="mt-4 text-center font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">
			gRPC is internal to the media plane — jawax_sfu calls jawax_transcode for control only.
			Raw RTP still moves over localhost UDP, never gRPC.
		</p>

		<ul class="mt-10 grid gap-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:grid-cols-3">
			<li class="rounded border border-white/10 p-4">
				<span class="text-foreground">Per-channel isolation.</span> One crashed
				transcode pipeline restarts under OTP without touching any other live channel.
			</li>
			<li class="rounded border border-white/10 p-4">
				<span class="text-foreground">Drain before deploy.</span> New connections
				stop, a 30s grace window runs, then the node restarts.
			</li>
			<li class="rounded border border-white/10 p-4">
				<span class="text-foreground">No Redis.</span> Postgres-backed jobs (Oban),
				PubSub for ephemeral coordination. One less thing to operate.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
